WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.591
You've got parts. Let's give them an order. Hold Menu and press pad ten for Song.

2
00:00:04.657 --> 00:00:10.397
Pad thirteen adds scene one. In Song, the pads represent scenes instead of individual clips.

3
00:00:10.397 --> 00:00:17.288
Pad fourteen adds scene two, and pad thirteen brings us back to scene one. A simple beginning, change, and return.

4
00:00:17.288 --> 00:00:24.108
Turn Q one to give the selected block another repeat. You can let a good part sit for a little longer.

5
00:00:24.108 --> 00:00:29.558
Press Play Start to hear the chain from the beginning. The blocks tell you which scene comes next.

6
00:00:29.558 --> 00:00:35.434
Stop when you've heard enough. The song stays editable, and Undo can take back the last arrangement change.
